post.description:
Record user feedback for a prior chat/search event.

Supports two payload shapes:
- Learning reranker feedback: {event_id, signal, doc_id?, note?}
- UI meta feedback: {rating, comment?, timestamp?, context?}

get.description:
SSE stream of Loki logs using incremental query_range polling.

Emits TerminalService-compatible SSE events:
- {"type":"log","message":"..."}
- {"type":"error","message":"..."}
- {"type":"complete"}
